WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.690
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:35.960 --> 01:37.039
Here it comes.

3
01:37.039 --> 01:38.560
You really caught one. It took the bait.

4
01:38.560 --> 01:39.720
It's such a big one.

5
01:40.080 --> 01:41.340
We didn't buy this one.

6
01:41.560 --> 01:42.960
This is a real river fish.

7
01:45.720 --> 01:46.680
It really is quite big. That's amazing.

8
01:46.680 --> 01:48.160
You are amazing, Sister Long.

9
01:48.160 --> 01:49.360
The director is here.

10
01:50.680 --> 01:51.479
President.

11
01:54.360 --> 01:56.759
Thank you for being willing to see me again.

12
01:57.320 --> 01:59.960
Is this case really that important to you?

13
02:02.840 --> 02:04.200
If you withdraw the lawsuit,

14
02:04.200 --> 02:06.200
the company will arrange for you to fly again

15
02:06.200 --> 02:08.860
and qualify you for a promotion to chief purser.

16
02:08.960 --> 02:11.490
I never thought of getting promoted this way.

17
02:11.960 --> 02:13.600
I just want fairness.

18
02:13.840 --> 02:15.680
Why are you so stubborn?

19
02:15.680 --> 02:17.320
Is fairness that important?

20
02:17.600 --> 02:20.200
Are you willing to keep wasting your time here?

21
02:27.280 --> 02:29.720
My client has been very persistent.

22
02:29.720 --> 02:31.840
She just wants a fair result.

23
02:32.360 --> 02:34.200
Then as her attorney,

24
02:34.480 --> 02:35.280
to be honest,

25
02:35.560 --> 02:37.040
I also want to prove to the judge

26
02:37.040 --> 02:37.920
that psychological trauma

27
02:37.920 --> 02:39.920
is a real wound

28
02:40.680 --> 02:42.280
and shouldn't be ignored.

29
02:45.400 --> 02:47.480
Lawyer Tian must have told you

30
02:47.480 --> 02:49.400
about the case I appeared in court for him.

31
02:49.400 --> 02:50.280
It's useless.

32
02:50.680 --> 02:51.840
It's all in vain.

33
02:52.840 --> 02:54.040
To tell you the truth,

34
02:54.280 --> 02:56.040
I'm very disappointed.

35
02:56.560 --> 02:58.920
Compared to the progress of social civilization and awareness,

36
02:58.920 --> 03:00.920
the judicial system is lagging too far behind.

37
03:00.920 --> 03:01.560
Yes.

38
03:03.280 --> 03:05.480
Director, I understand your concerns.

39
03:05.840 --> 03:07.680
But we've also done some research.

40
03:07.680 --> 03:08.280
Actually,

41
03:08.280 --> 03:09.280
there are now domestic precedents

42
03:09.280 --> 03:11.280
supporting psychological trauma.

43
03:11.280 --> 03:12.410
What does this mean?

44
03:12.560 --> 03:14.320
It means times have changed.

45
03:14.760 --> 03:16.040
Although it seems right now

46
03:16.040 --> 03:17.840
that our efforts are very small,

47
03:18.040 --> 03:20.280
it is only these tiny efforts

48
03:20.400 --> 03:22.680
that can drive the progress of the times, isn't it?

49
03:22.680 --> 03:24.480
How would we know if we don't try?

50
03:24.680 --> 03:25.480
Director,

51
03:25.920 --> 03:28.200
we must have faith in the law.

52
03:29.560 --> 03:30.890
Faith alone is useless.

53
03:31.280 --> 03:33.140
How can the judge believe just me?

54
03:33.680 --> 03:34.280
I think

55
03:35.040 --> 03:38.360
if we let the court know more about the public's

56
03:38.360 --> 03:40.000
views on this incident,

57
03:40.840 --> 03:42.240
it would be more helpful.

58
03:43.680 --> 03:44.440
What does that mean?

59
03:44.440 --> 03:46.570
Are you going to appear in court or not?

60
03:49.079 --> 03:51.079
I understand, Director. Thank you.

61
03:51.280 --> 03:53.000
I've said all I have to say.

62
03:53.400 --> 03:54.079
Young man,

63
03:55.079 --> 03:55.840
let it go.

64
03:57.440 --> 03:58.900
You didn't catch it to eat?

65
04:13.400 --> 04:14.000
Psychological Trauma Cognitive Questionnaire

66
04:14.000 --> 04:15.480
For specific cases, there are no right or wrong answers. Please answer based on your true thoughts. Thank you for your support!

67
04:15.480 --> 04:16.160
2. In a confined space, how would you feel if a male stranger suppressed and assaulted you?

68
04:16.160 --> 04:17.560
Excuse me, am I bothering you?

69
04:17.560 --> 04:17.839
Not at all.

70
04:17.839 --> 04:19.700
Well, I'm doing a questionnaire,

71
04:19.839 --> 04:20.680
doing this...

72
04:20.680 --> 04:22.720
Psychological Trauma Cognitive Questionnaire.

73
04:22.720 --> 04:24.120
Hey handsome, come help us fill out a form.

74
04:24.120 --> 04:25.560
Sister Pang's Bathhouse is having an event.

75
04:25.560 --> 04:27.840
Fill out the Psychological Trauma Cognitive Questionnaire,

76
04:27.840 --> 04:31.440
and get a free choice of vinegar, salt, or milk for your scrub.

77
04:59.120 --> 05:00.160
What are you looking at?

78
05:00.160 --> 05:02.360
I'm not copying. I'm just taking a look.

79
05:04.400 --> 05:05.160
Longnv.

80
05:05.560 --> 05:07.880
I had someone at the market make these today.

81
05:07.880 --> 05:08.840
That's a lot.

82
05:08.840 --> 05:09.840
Thanks for your hard work, Squad Leader.

83
05:09.840 --> 05:10.680
Thank you, Squad Leader.

84
05:10.680 --> 05:11.680
Squad Leader is here too.

85
05:11.680 --> 05:13.840
Beihu, let's grab a bite together. Come on.

86
05:13.840 --> 05:15.160
Let me tell my wife first.

87
05:15.160 --> 05:17.400
Honey, I won't be home for dinner today.

88
05:17.400 --> 05:18.530
Get some rest early.

89
05:18.560 --> 05:19.080
Mwah.

90
05:19.240 --> 05:20.360
Mwah.

91
05:20.400 --> 05:22.200
This is a meme from two years ago.

92
05:22.280 --> 05:24.280
Everything is just a passing cloud.

93
05:29.400 --> 05:31.840
These are the questionnaires we've done over the past few days.

94
05:31.840 --> 05:33.840
If it's not enough, we can continue.

95
05:46.840 --> 05:48.240
What's the suitcase for?

96
05:48.720 --> 05:51.780
Lawyer Li is the airline's lawyer. Of course he's here.

97
06:02.120 --> 06:03.480
Court is now in session.

98
06:04.720 --> 06:06.840
Will the expert assistant please explain

99
06:06.840 --> 06:09.500
what these questionnaires are meant to convey.

100
06:10.480 --> 06:12.480
The questions in the questionnaire include

101
06:12.480 --> 06:15.840
asking respondents to imagine themselves in a confined space,

102
06:15.840 --> 06:19.000
being pinned down and torn at by a strange man.

103
06:19.040 --> 06:21.480
92% of female respondents

104
06:21.480 --> 06:22.920
and 69% of

105
06:22.920 --> 06:24.480
male respondents stated

106
06:24.480 --> 06:25.960
that they would view this behavior

107
06:25.960 --> 06:28.880
as a violent assault and feel fear.

108
06:29.040 --> 06:31.120
Do the appellant's symptoms meet

109
06:31.120 --> 06:33.159
the diagnostic criteria for Acute Stress Disorder?

110
06:33.159 --> 06:34.840
Based on the medical records,

111
06:35.000 --> 06:37.200
I believe they fully meet the criteria.

112
06:37.480 --> 06:40.360
Does the appellee wish to question the expert assistant?

113
06:40.360 --> 06:41.040
Yes.

114
06:42.120 --> 06:43.480
Let me make an assumption here.

115
06:43.480 --> 06:45.480
If I also memorized those

116
06:45.480 --> 06:46.600
answers that could lead to a diagnosis

117
06:46.600 --> 06:48.040
of ASD,

118
06:48.040 --> 06:50.480
and filled them out exactly as they are,

119
06:50.480 --> 06:52.720
would I also be diagnosed

120
06:52.720 --> 06:53.480
with ASD?

121
06:54.360 --> 06:55.159
Very likely.

122
06:55.720 --> 06:57.480
Dean Zhuge, I would like to ask,

123
06:57.720 --> 07:00.360
based on Xu Jiayi's questionnaire that you saw,

124
07:00.360 --> 07:01.480
how likely do you think it is

125
07:01.480 --> 07:04.360
that Xu Jiayi memorized the answers

126
07:04.360 --> 07:05.040
in advance?

127
07:05.240 --> 07:06.240
Extremely unlikely.

128
07:06.240 --> 07:08.600
From the details of her handwriting,

129
07:08.600 --> 07:10.120
I can even feel her emotions.

130
07:10.120 --> 07:12.160
How can you prove that Xu Jiayi's

131
07:12.240 --> 07:12.840
ASD

132
07:12.840 --> 07:14.480
was caused by Hu Sheng?

133
07:14.840 --> 07:16.480
Xu Jiayi's symptoms appeared

134
07:16.480 --> 07:18.600
only a few days after the conflict.

135
07:18.840 --> 07:21.240
It corresponds logically in terms of time.

136
07:21.480 --> 07:23.000
Moreover, the infringement occurred

137
07:23.000 --> 07:24.840
in a confined space like an airplane cabin.

138
07:24.840 --> 07:26.480
This would further amplify the victim's

139
07:26.480 --> 07:29.480
subjective assessment of the threat and danger.

140
07:29.840 --> 07:32.159
Since you also mentioned subjective assessment,

141
07:32.159 --> 07:33.240
is it possible

142
07:33.240 --> 07:35.040
that the conflict itself was not enough

143
07:35.040 --> 07:36.840
to cause much harm to Xu Jiayi,

144
07:36.840 --> 07:37.240
and the reason for her

145
07:37.240 --> 07:38.360
ASD

146
07:38.360 --> 07:40.000
is her own vulnerability?

147
07:40.720 --> 07:41.850
It is very possible.

148
07:42.240 --> 07:43.600
Most studies have found that

149
07:43.600 --> 07:44.480
for ASD,

150
07:44.480 --> 07:45.120
the incidence rate

151
07:45.120 --> 07:46.480
shows gender differences.

152
07:46.480 --> 07:48.840
The incidence in women is significantly higher than in men.

153
07:48.840 --> 07:50.240
If you say she is vulnerable,

154
07:50.240 --> 07:51.600
it only further strengthens

155
07:51.600 --> 07:52.720
the connection between her ASD

156
07:52.720 --> 07:54.480
and this conflict.

157
07:55.040 --> 07:56.040
Our society

158
07:56.040 --> 07:58.120
has always emphasized the rule of law and civilization.

159
07:58.120 --> 07:59.240
What is the rule of law?

160
07:59.240 --> 08:01.600
The rule of law is to make the weak fearless.

161
08:01.600 --> 08:02.840
What is civilization?

162
08:02.840 --> 08:05.170
Civilization is to give the weak dignity.

163
08:05.480 --> 08:08.160
Every word you say favors the appellant.

164
08:08.360 --> 08:10.820
Were you hired by them through the back door?

165
08:11.040 --> 08:13.240
Please observe courtroom discipline.

166
08:14.480 --> 08:17.160
Do both parties have anything to add to their final statements?

167
08:17.160 --> 08:17.720
I do.

168
08:19.160 --> 08:20.240
Regarding this conflict

169
08:20.240 --> 08:22.160
involving my client in the cabin,

170
08:22.480 --> 08:25.160
many people say she is making a fuss over nothing

171
08:25.360 --> 08:26.840
and being overly sensitive.

172
08:26.840 --> 08:28.840
That's because this trauma

173
08:28.840 --> 08:31.160
is invisible and intangible.

174
08:31.480 --> 08:33.159
But psychological harm

175
08:33.159 --> 08:34.679
is also real.

176
08:35.400 --> 08:36.320
It's just that

177
08:36.320 --> 08:39.120
there is no accurate physiological numerical standard

178
08:39.120 --> 08:41.760
to define its existence

179
08:41.760 --> 08:43.400
and severity in the judicial system.

180
08:43.400 --> 08:45.640
resulting in the rights of some patients with mental illness

181
08:45.640 --> 08:47.160
being unprotected.

182
08:48.080 --> 08:50.800
Nowadays, our society pays more attention to

183
08:50.800 --> 08:53.130
mental health and psychological issues.

184
08:53.160 --> 08:55.360
And some domestic courts have already

185
08:55.480 --> 08:57.800
started to recognize psychological trauma.

186
08:57.800 --> 08:59.160
I think our Leyang

187
08:59.480 --> 09:01.800
should keep pace with the times.

188
09:08.600 --> 09:09.800
It's still the same issue.

189
09:09.800 --> 09:12.330
Her symptom is called acute stress disorder.

190
09:12.480 --> 09:13.600
As for the resulting damage,

191
09:13.600 --> 09:15.480
we currently have no way to quantify it.

192
09:15.480 --> 09:16.920
There is no standard for determination.

193
09:16.920 --> 09:18.800
If so, the causal relationship

194
09:18.800 --> 09:20.360
between this result and the appellee's behavior

195
09:20.360 --> 09:22.360
is hard to determine.

196
09:22.360 --> 09:23.240
Recently,

197
09:23.240 --> 09:24.360
I have carefully studied

198
09:24.360 --> 09:25.800
the materials provided by the appellant.

199
09:25.800 --> 09:27.240
I think it's enough to prove

200
09:27.240 --> 09:29.360
that the mental damage is not groundless.

201
09:29.360 --> 09:30.840
I've read those cases.

202
09:30.840 --> 09:32.700
The materials are very detailed.

203
09:33.000 --> 09:34.360
But in our region,

204
09:34.480 --> 09:36.610
there has never been such a precedent.

205
09:37.000 --> 09:39.600
It's a difficult choice to make.

206
09:48.480 --> 09:49.480
Please be seated.

207
09:52.600 --> 09:56.160
In the case of Xu Jiayi v. Hu Sheng regarding the right to life and health,

208
09:56.160 --> 09:57.620
after trial by this court,

209
09:57.840 --> 10:01.120
it is determined that Xu Jiayi has suffered psychological injury,

210
10:01.120 --> 10:02.760
and it has a direct causal relationship

211
10:02.760 --> 10:04.690
with Hu Sheng's extreme behavior.

212
10:04.720 --> 10:06.980
The judgment of this court is as follows.

213
10:08.480 --> 10:09.360
All rise.

214
10:12.640 --> 10:15.440
1. The first-instance civil judgment is revoked.

215
10:16.360 --> 10:18.480
2. Within seven days after this judgment

216
10:18.480 --> 10:20.080
takes effect, Hu Sheng shall

217
10:20.120 --> 10:22.780
publicly apologize to the plaintiff, Xu Jiayi,

218
10:23.120 --> 10:25.360
and pin it to the top for a week without removal.

219
10:25.360 --> 10:27.760
3. Hu Sheng shall, upon this judgment...

220
10:27.760 --> 10:30.240
Actually, I have a different opinion.

221
10:31.000 --> 10:34.000
Our practice should keep pace with the times.

222
10:34.360 --> 10:36.480
After all, progress isn't something we wait for,

223
10:36.480 --> 10:38.480
but something we create ourselves.

224
10:39.000 --> 10:40.840
There's a first time for everything,

225
10:40.840 --> 10:42.120
and we shouldn't be afraid

226
10:42.120 --> 10:43.360
to be the first.

227
10:43.480 --> 10:45.720
pay medical expenses of 2,250 yuan.

228
10:46.000 --> 10:47.600
8,000 yuan for lost wages

229
10:47.720 --> 10:50.480
and 12,000 yuan for mental distress.

230
10:50.880 --> 10:54.600
The case acceptance fees for the first and second instances shall be borne by Hu Sheng.

231
10:54.600 --> 10:57.000
This judgment is final.

232
10:57.360 --> 10:59.240
The court is now adjourned.

233
11:02.480 --> 11:03.840
Let's just order some takeout at the law firm later.

234
11:03.840 --> 11:04.600
Let's get something to eat.

235
11:04.600 --> 11:05.760
Why order takeout?

236
11:05.840 --> 11:07.360
I can just show off my cooking skills.

237
11:07.360 --> 11:08.600
You can cook?

238
11:08.600 --> 11:09.200
Leyang God of Cookery.

239
11:09.200 --> 11:10.120
Guaranteed to win.

240
11:10.120 --> 11:11.650
Is this the result I wanted?

241
11:12.120 --> 11:14.580
The verdict is out. There's nothing I can do.

242
11:18.120 --> 11:19.360
What are you looking at?

243
11:19.360 --> 11:20.120
I see.

244
11:20.120 --> 11:22.360
Mr. Hu, we all know

245
11:22.600 --> 11:23.860
your time is precious.

246
11:24.120 --> 11:25.200
Since everyone is here,

247
11:25.200 --> 11:27.120
why don't you just apologize?

248
11:27.120 --> 11:29.850
Then we won't have to see each other again, right?

249
11:30.960 --> 11:34.560
You've been making a fuss for so long just for money, haven't you?

250
11:34.600 --> 11:36.360
Fine, I'll add 50,000.

251
11:37.360 --> 11:38.080
Not enough.

252
11:38.600 --> 11:39.840
Then I'll add another 100,000.

253
11:39.840 --> 11:41.120
Is that enough to cover an apology?

254
11:41.120 --> 11:41.960
No, it's not.

255
11:42.360 --> 11:43.600
We don't want money.

256
11:43.640 --> 11:44.760
We just want an apology.

257
11:44.760 --> 11:45.960
Isn't that annoying?

258
11:45.960 --> 11:46.840
I just won't apologize.

259
11:46.840 --> 11:47.600
Isn't that annoying?

260
11:47.600 --> 11:49.600
Then just wait for the court to publish the verdict.

261
11:49.600 --> 11:51.360
Let the published verdict be your apology.

262
11:51.360 --> 11:52.360
You're so ungrateful.

263
11:52.360 --> 11:53.120
Who are you calling ungrateful?

264
11:53.120 --> 11:54.240
Mr. Hu, let's go.

265
11:54.240 --> 11:54.600
What do you say?

266
11:54.600 --> 11:55.960
Go? Why should we go?

267
11:56.840 --> 11:58.320
A flight attendant

268
11:58.320 --> 11:59.120
and a lousy lawyer.

269
11:59.120 --> 12:00.840
You wouldn't even see me without this stupid case.

270
12:00.840 --> 12:02.960
You will all pay the price,

271
12:02.960 --> 12:03.360
you know?

272
12:03.360 --> 12:04.360
Mr. Hu.

273
12:05.360 --> 12:06.360
What price?

274
12:07.600 --> 12:09.520
The price for insult,

275
12:09.520 --> 12:11.960
or the price for threatening others?

276
12:12.120 --> 12:13.120
This is the court.

277
12:13.120 --> 12:14.120
It's quite convenient.

278
12:14.120 --> 12:15.080
You...

279
12:15.080 --> 12:15.600
Mr. Hu.

280
12:16.520 --> 12:17.360
Stop making a scene.

281
12:17.360 --> 12:18.320
Just apologize.

282
12:18.320 --> 12:19.440
A wise man knows when to retreat.

283
12:19.440 --> 12:20.960
What? Stop making a scene?

284
12:21.600 --> 12:22.440
Wan Gang.

285
12:31.840 --> 12:33.080
That flight attendant.

286
12:33.080 --> 12:33.840
I'm sorry.

287
12:34.360 --> 12:35.890
What's with your attitude?

288
12:36.320 --> 12:37.360
Are you asking for a napkin?

289
12:37.360 --> 12:38.690
It's fine, Lawyer Xiao.

290
12:48.600 --> 12:50.060
You can't hurt me anymore.

291
12:55.080 --> 12:56.440
What are you talking about?

292
12:56.440 --> 12:57.600
No, you...

293
12:57.600 --> 12:58.480
What are you talking about?

294
12:58.480 --> 13:00.360
I'm the victim in this case.

295
13:00.360 --> 13:02.160
Mr. Hu, stop making a scene. I...

296
13:02.360 --> 13:03.440
And you.

297
13:03.600 --> 13:05.200
I spent so much money

298
13:05.200 --> 13:06.880
hiring you to represent me,

299
13:06.880 --> 13:08.760
not to lose my case.

300
13:08.760 --> 13:09.360
With that much money,

301
13:09.360 --> 13:10.600
I'd be better off raising pigs than you.

302
13:10.600 --> 13:11.880
Even pigs are better than you, you know?

303
13:11.880 --> 13:12.740
Say something.

304
13:17.120 --> 13:18.360
I'm done.

305
13:22.840 --> 13:23.840
Wait, Wu Yong.

306
13:24.360 --> 13:26.090
Thanks for your help this time.

307
13:26.840 --> 13:28.840
You really did a great job this time.

308
13:30.120 --> 13:31.840
Lawyer Li knows how to compliment people now,

309
13:31.840 --> 13:33.120
and so directly too.

310
13:34.120 --> 13:35.120
What do you mean?

311
13:35.120 --> 13:37.120
I've always known how to compliment people.

312
13:37.120 --> 13:37.960
Really?

313
13:38.080 --> 13:38.840
Where are you going? I'll give you a ride.

314
13:38.840 --> 13:39.360
No need.

315
13:39.840 --> 13:42.320
I invited everyone to eat at my law firm.

316
13:42.640 --> 13:44.770
If you're not busy, you can come along.

317
13:45.840 --> 13:46.600
Sure.

318
13:48.600 --> 13:49.840
You're not busy?

319
13:49.840 --> 13:50.520
Not busy.

320
13:51.840 --> 13:53.320
Come to my law firm to eat.

321
13:53.320 --> 13:54.200
I heard you.

322
13:54.640 --> 13:55.600
Let's take my car.

323
13:55.600 --> 13:58.060
I don't feel safe with Little Tiger driving.

324
13:58.600 --> 14:00.400
Don't you need to read the files?

325
14:00.960 --> 14:03.090
If you're busy, don't force yourself.

326
14:03.840 --> 14:04.900
What are you doing?

327
14:05.600 --> 14:07.460
Didn't we agree to eat at the firm?

328
14:08.960 --> 14:09.880
Sister Long said

329
14:09.880 --> 14:12.040
Lawyer Li is eating with us today.

330
14:12.240 --> 14:13.840
Great. The more, the merrier.

331
14:13.840 --> 14:15.360
No, why is he going?

332
14:15.360 --> 14:16.840
Doesn't he have food at home?

333
14:16.840 --> 14:18.840
Are there enough chairs at the firm?

334
14:20.040 --> 14:21.370
He's so inconsiderate.

335
14:27.160 --> 14:29.440
Uncle, how come you forgot how to drive?

336
14:35.840 --> 14:37.120
Here's the tableware.

337
14:39.840 --> 14:40.320
Miao.

338
14:40.600 --> 14:42.120
Go get a new set of bowls and chopsticks.

339
14:42.120 --> 14:43.360
Li Lü is a germaphobe.

340
14:43.440 --> 14:44.320
Understood.

341
14:44.880 --> 14:47.240
Li Lü doesn't look like he can cook.

342
14:47.600 --> 14:48.360
He's very good at it.

343
14:48.360 --> 14:50.600
He's been cooking since he was a kid, and it's delicious.

344
14:50.600 --> 14:52.440
My uncle also said he's been cooking since he was a kid.

345
14:52.440 --> 14:53.120
Really?

346
14:53.840 --> 14:55.120
Shouldn't we go help?

347
14:55.120 --> 14:56.840
Is it appropriate to let the two men cook?

348
14:56.840 --> 14:58.600
What's inappropriate about it?

349
14:58.600 --> 15:00.600
The kitchen should be a man's battlefield.

350
15:00.600 --> 15:02.600
Then let's sit here and wait to eat.

351
15:50.120 --> 15:51.650
We're exactly three short.

352
16:17.360 --> 16:18.440
What are you looking at?

353
16:18.440 --> 16:19.500
Eat your heart out.

354
16:29.080 --> 16:29.880
Look at this.

355
16:31.320 --> 16:32.250
These dishes are

356
16:33.120 --> 16:35.360
a combination of Chinese and Western styles.

357
16:35.360 --> 16:37.840
I didn't expect Lawyer Li to be so handsome,

358
16:37.840 --> 16:39.480
and his cooking to be so beautiful too.

359
16:39.480 --> 16:40.200
Yes, thank you.

360
16:40.200 --> 16:42.600
Lawyer Li, these dishes are perfect for me.

361
16:42.600 --> 16:43.360
Low oil and low salt,

362
16:43.360 --> 16:44.360
healthy and good for weight loss.

363
16:44.360 --> 16:45.360
Then eat more.

364
16:46.120 --> 16:46.840
Yeah.

365
16:46.880 --> 16:48.360
We're tired after a long day, eating some leaves,

366
16:48.360 --> 16:50.320
and then going back to our cages to sleep at night.

367
16:50.320 --> 16:51.520
What do you mean, leaves?

368
16:51.520 --> 16:53.320
Steak, meat pies.

369
16:53.320 --> 16:54.760
These are all heavy dishes.

370
16:54.760 --> 16:55.080
Well,

371
16:55.080 --> 16:56.840
come on, let's propose a toast.

372
16:56.840 --> 16:58.360
Um, I want to say something.

373
16:58.360 --> 17:00.360
Everyone has been working so hard for my case

374
17:00.360 --> 17:01.760
for such a long time.

375
17:01.760 --> 17:03.120
I want to toast everyone

376
17:03.120 --> 17:03.600
to thank you all.

377
17:03.600 --> 17:05.359
Jiayi, we should toast you.

378
17:05.359 --> 17:06.520
To your bravery,

379
17:06.520 --> 17:07.599
and your persistence,

380
17:07.599 --> 17:09.359
which made this case a success.

381
17:09.599 --> 17:10.319
Right?

382
17:11.359 --> 17:11.839
Cheers.

383
17:11.839 --> 17:12.640
Thank you all.

384
17:12.839 --> 17:13.599
Cheers.

385
17:13.960 --> 17:14.359
Uncle.

386
17:17.119 --> 17:17.839
Jiayi.

387
17:18.319 --> 17:20.849
What you said to Hu Sheng at the end was so cool.

388
17:20.880 --> 17:22.119
How did it go again?

389
17:23.359 --> 17:25.119
"You can't hurt me anymore."

390
17:25.119 --> 17:26.240
So cool.

391
17:26.359 --> 17:27.880
Yeah, just that one sentence

392
17:27.880 --> 17:29.840
broke Hu Sheng's defenses instantly.

393
17:29.840 --> 17:31.640
His face changed immediately.

394
17:31.640 --> 17:33.360
Winning this case

395
17:33.360 --> 17:34.600
is actually, to me

396
17:34.600 --> 17:35.960
and to Director Zhuge,

397
17:35.960 --> 17:37.600
a great encouragement.

398
17:37.600 --> 17:39.360
I should really thank everyone.

399
17:39.360 --> 17:40.760
Our old monitor is right.

400
17:40.840 --> 17:42.840
With the successful precedent of Jiayi's case,

401
17:42.840 --> 17:44.360
for similar cases in the future,

402
17:44.360 --> 17:45.360
the court will have to take them seriously.

403
17:45.360 --> 17:47.120
Anyway, we did a good thing.

404
17:47.360 --> 17:47.760
Right?

405
17:47.960 --> 17:49.120
Come on, let's have a toast.

406
17:49.120 --> 17:49.960
Come on.

407
17:50.120 --> 17:51.380
We're all good people.

408
17:52.760 --> 17:54.600
Alright, don't be so formal.

409
17:54.600 --> 17:55.660
Let's eat. Come on.

410
18:00.600 --> 18:01.840
What's gotten into you?

411
18:01.840 --> 18:03.300
Laughing like that again.

412
18:03.360 --> 18:05.220
I did a good thing. Don't scold me.

413
18:05.640 --> 18:06.360
Come on.

414
18:06.840 --> 18:07.960
No, Wu Yong.

415
18:09.360 --> 18:10.420
Wu Yong, come back.

416
18:11.200 --> 18:11.960
Serves him right.

417
18:11.960 --> 18:12.880
Look at the bullet comments.

418
18:12.880 --> 18:14.320
They are all scolding Hu Sheng.

419
18:14.320 --> 18:14.960
Really?

420
18:15.120 --> 18:16.200
I even posted two.

421
18:17.600 --> 18:18.440
My name is Hu Sheng.

422
18:18.440 --> 18:19.360
I just want to humiliate

423
18:19.360 --> 18:20.120
and hurt others.

424
18:20.120 --> 18:21.360
Everyone, look at the verdict.

425
18:21.360 --> 18:22.360
Lose, lose, lose.

426
18:22.600 --> 18:23.840
The court ruled

427
18:23.840 --> 18:24.840
that even a pig is better than you.

428
18:24.840 --> 18:25.840
Strange, strange.

429
18:25.840 --> 18:26.440
Hurt, hurt.

430
18:26.440 --> 18:27.360
Come back, come back.

431
18:27.360 --> 18:27.840
As a

432
18:27.840 --> 18:29.600
completely lawless

433
18:29.600 --> 18:30.640
psychopath,

434
18:30.640 --> 18:31.360
I have decided

435
18:31.360 --> 18:32.320
to sue and

436
18:32.320 --> 18:33.920
hurt this flight attendant.

437
18:41.320 --> 18:42.160
Bastard.

438
18:44.400 --> 18:46.600
Actually, this case is already closed.

439
18:46.880 --> 18:49.080
There's no need to cause new conflicts.

440
18:49.640 --> 18:51.640
Why is this guy such a buzzkill?

441
18:51.800 --> 18:52.320
So what?

442
18:52.320 --> 18:52.960
No matter how powerful he is,

443
18:52.960 --> 18:54.800
can he fight against all the netizens in the country?

444
18:54.800 --> 18:55.960
I have to put him on the internet

445
18:55.960 --> 18:57.680
and let him experience cyberbullying.

446
18:57.680 --> 18:59.400
Otherwise, he'll really think he's something.

447
18:59.400 --> 19:01.400
Yes, this video is quite satisfying.

448
19:01.400 --> 19:02.800
But if it angers Hu Sheng,

449
19:02.800 --> 19:04.530
and he sues you for defamation,

450
19:04.880 --> 19:06.040
or if he targets Jiayi and the airline

451
19:06.040 --> 19:07.640
with more extreme actions,

452
19:07.960 --> 19:09.080
how will you handle it?

453
19:09.080 --> 19:10.640
You don't have to handle it anyway.

454
19:10.640 --> 19:11.920
Stop worrying, okay?

455
19:16.080 --> 19:16.800
Well,

456
19:19.800 --> 19:20.660
just delete it.

457
19:24.800 --> 19:25.960
Don't throw a tantrum.

458
19:25.960 --> 19:27.160
Who are you giving attitude to?

459
19:27.160 --> 19:28.640
Wait, don't delete it.

460
19:28.880 --> 19:29.640
Leave it up for a night.

461
19:29.640 --> 19:31.640
Let him get the full immersive experience, right?

462
19:31.640 --> 19:32.640
Yeah, yeah.

463
19:32.760 --> 19:33.960
Remember to delete it tomorrow.

464
19:33.960 --> 19:36.020
It makes sense to delete it tomorrow.

465
19:38.760 --> 19:39.160
Come on.

466
19:39.160 --> 19:40.080
Let's all join in.

467
19:40.080 --> 19:41.280
Let me say a few words.

468
19:41.880 --> 19:43.880
Welcome to my home, everyone.

469
19:43.880 --> 19:46.920
And let's celebrate Jiayi stepping out of the shadows.

470
19:46.920 --> 19:47.650
That rhymes.

471
19:48.920 --> 19:49.640
What I mean is,

472
19:49.640 --> 19:51.400
the main point is to eat and drink well.

473
19:51.400 --> 19:52.760
Let's drink up, okay?

474
19:52.760 --> 19:53.440
Okay.

475
19:53.440 --> 19:54.080
Let's get together often.

476
19:54.080 --> 19:54.880
Thank you all.

477
19:54.880 --> 19:57.520
You really can't come up with anything better to say, huh.

478
19:57.520 --> 19:58.640
I'm just happy.

479
20:02.880 --> 20:03.800
It's so nice.

480
20:04.800 --> 20:06.800
It's great to see Jiayi smile again.

481
20:07.160 --> 20:10.080
I feel like I've done something meaningful.

482
20:13.680 --> 20:16.240
Psychological trauma doesn't heal that quickly.

483
20:16.240 --> 20:17.640
I hope she finds a way

484
20:17.640 --> 20:19.240
to cope with the trauma soon.

485
20:24.280 --> 20:25.140
What about you?

486
20:26.880 --> 20:28.400
What way did you find?

487
20:33.040 --> 20:34.640
In an uncertain life,

488
20:36.560 --> 20:37.760
finding certainty.

489
20:41.040 --> 20:42.080
So,

490
20:43.160 --> 20:45.640
what you found is the law.

491
20:49.960 --> 20:51.560
That's very much your style.

492
20:52.400 --> 20:53.640
But don't you think

493
20:54.160 --> 20:56.160
blindly pursuing this certainty

494
20:57.200 --> 20:59.400
will make you lose many possibilities?

495
20:59.800 --> 21:02.040
And many surprises in life

496
21:02.160 --> 21:03.400
are found in these possibilities,

497
21:03.400 --> 21:05.080
growing little by little.

498
21:05.640 --> 21:07.280
What if it's a shock instead?

499
21:07.800 --> 21:09.400
Who could be scarier than me?

500
21:11.560 --> 21:12.560
It's just four bags of trash.

501
21:12.560 --> 21:14.020
You can't bring them down?

502
21:14.480 --> 21:16.210
Move around a bit after eating.

503
21:16.400 --> 21:17.760
I'll go up first, Uncle.

504
21:25.160 --> 21:28.400
To be honest, I don't think he's a good fit for you...

505
21:29.080 --> 21:30.480
...I mean, your law firm.

506
21:32.880 --> 21:35.800
The video thing isn't as serious as you think.

507
21:35.800 --> 21:37.200
It's not about the video.

508
21:38.640 --> 21:39.880
You made such a big decision

509
21:39.880 --> 21:41.040
to start this law firm.

510
21:41.040 --> 21:43.300
You should find someone who can help you.

511
21:44.800 --> 21:45.920
You don't know him.

512
21:46.000 --> 21:47.130
Do you know him well?

513
21:50.920 --> 21:53.450
Wait, I feel like someone is talking about me.

514
21:56.640 --> 21:58.560
Could they be talking about me on the balcony?

515
21:58.560 --> 22:00.720
Uncle, you're overthinking it.

516
22:00.920 --> 22:03.280
Who knows? What does it have to do with you?

517
22:03.320 --> 22:05.160
I'm just worried Sister Long might get fooled.

518
22:05.160 --> 22:06.720
What does it have to do with me?

519
22:06.720 --> 22:08.440
Lawyer Li is much more reliable than you.

520
22:08.440 --> 22:10.560
They are high school classmates and childhood friends.

521
22:10.560 --> 22:12.400
Childhood sweethearts, you know?

522
22:12.400 --> 22:13.640
No wonder at first glance,

523
22:13.640 --> 22:15.640
I thought they were a perfect match.

524
22:16.040 --> 22:17.900
Their relationship is that deep?

525
22:19.400 --> 22:20.560
Wanna make a bet?

526
22:21.680 --> 22:22.800
What are we betting on?

527
22:22.800 --> 22:23.840
Betting that

528
22:24.240 --> 22:26.680
my ragtag team can make it.

529
22:33.400 --> 22:35.600
Xiaolong, I really hope you can make it.

530
22:36.680 --> 22:38.160
Whether as an opponent

531
22:40.640 --> 22:41.680
or as a friend.

532
22:44.920 --> 22:47.680
Then I sincerely hope your wish comes true.

533
22:50.640 --> 22:51.840
May my wish come true.

534
23:04.080 --> 23:06.400
The candied sweet potato didn't impress them.

535
23:06.400 --> 23:08.860
Next time, I'll make snowy bean paste puffs.

536
23:23.240 --> 23:24.560
What is it?

537
23:44.080 --> 23:46.360
Open the door quickly. I got my internship salary.

538
23:46.360 --> 23:47.160
What are you doing?

539
23:47.160 --> 23:47.960
You scared me.

540
23:48.600 --> 23:49.320
Look at you.

541
23:49.320 --> 23:50.320
You're not calm at all.

542
23:50.320 --> 23:52.320
It's not a big deal. Is it necessary?

543
24:07.600 --> 24:08.330
I'm leaving.

544
24:08.360 --> 24:09.490
Where are you going?

545
24:10.240 --> 24:11.080
To work.

546
24:11.360 --> 24:13.220
How long are you going to lie to us?

547
24:13.800 --> 24:16.320
If we hadn't noticed something was wrong last time

548
24:16.320 --> 24:17.560
and gone to your company to ask,

549
24:17.560 --> 24:20.020
were you planning to keep it from us forever?

550
24:25.560 --> 24:27.680
Hello, Director. Thank you, Director.

551
24:27.680 --> 24:29.160
Happy to get your salary, huh?

552
24:29.160 --> 24:31.800
Yes. I didn't help much with this case,

553
24:31.840 --> 24:33.000
but you still gave me money.

554
24:33.000 --> 24:34.240
You can't say that.

555
24:34.240 --> 24:35.960
You should get paid if you work.

556
24:35.960 --> 24:36.960
Anyway, work hard,

557
24:36.960 --> 24:38.800
and we'll make big money in the future.

558
24:38.800 --> 24:39.960
Look at you.

559
24:40.320 --> 24:42.000
What are your orders today, Director?

560
24:42.000 --> 24:44.440
You're quite eager after getting a little salary.

561
24:44.440 --> 24:45.800
What do you mean eager?

562
24:45.800 --> 24:46.600
Give me the bag. Come on.

563
24:46.600 --> 24:48.330
You must be tired from the trip.

564
24:49.360 --> 24:51.160
Although you didn't bring in this case,

565
24:51.160 --> 24:53.000
you also put in a lot of effort.

566
24:53.000 --> 24:54.160
Anyway, in the future,

567
24:54.160 --> 24:55.840
as long as you participate in a case,

568
24:55.840 --> 24:56.800
you'll get a base salary.

569
24:56.800 --> 24:59.360
I must participate. I'll actively participate.

570
24:59.360 --> 25:01.080
Where's Miao? Why isn't she here yet?

571
25:01.080 --> 25:02.000
I don't know. I haven't seen her.

572
25:02.000 --> 25:02.680
She probably overslept.

573
25:02.680 --> 25:03.920
Miao is never late.

574
25:03.920 --> 25:04.920
Did something happen?

575
25:04.920 --> 25:05.920
Call her quickly

576
25:05.920 --> 25:07.120
and see what's wrong.

577
25:12.640 --> 25:13.360
Let's not call.

578
25:13.360 --> 25:15.560
What if we interrupt something?

579
25:15.560 --> 25:16.400
Right.

580
25:16.640 --> 25:17.880
What could happen?

581
25:18.400 --> 25:19.440
Nothing, right?

582
25:20.920 --> 25:22.560
Come on, Luo Zhi, stop fidgeting.

583
25:22.560 --> 25:23.680
Come on, what is it? Tell the truth.

584
25:23.680 --> 25:25.280
Tell me everything you know.

585
25:26.840 --> 25:27.880
He doesn't know anything.

586
25:27.880 --> 25:28.960
I don't know anything either.

587
25:28.960 --> 25:30.680
How could we hide anything from you?

588
25:30.680 --> 25:32.080
I'm going to the bathroom. Are you coming?

589
25:32.080 --> 25:32.360
Yes.

590
25:32.360 --> 25:32.960
Let's go.

591
25:33.160 --> 25:34.220
Stand right there.

592
25:34.360 --> 25:35.160
Turn around.

593
25:36.200 --> 25:37.120
Swear it.

594
25:38.400 --> 25:40.200
I swear. If I'm hiding anything from you,

595
25:40.200 --> 25:41.400
Luo Zhi will fail his bar exam again.

596
25:41.400 --> 25:43.440
Uncle, don't swear on this.

597
25:46.080 --> 25:48.120
The family got you a good job.

598
25:48.320 --> 25:49.320
It wasn't easy.

599
25:49.600 --> 25:51.000
How could you let us down?

600
25:51.080 --> 25:53.880
Miaomiao, we are doing this for your own good.

601
25:54.160 --> 25:55.640
You can't be so willful.

602
26:00.200 --> 26:02.600
Miaomiao, thank you for helping me so much.

603
26:02.760 --> 26:04.440
This incident made me realize

604
26:04.440 --> 26:06.800
that life isn't just about tolerance and compromise,

605
26:06.800 --> 26:08.760
but also about persistence and bravery.

606
26:08.760 --> 26:09.440
Jiayi,

607
26:09.440 --> 26:11.200
your psychological evaluation report is out.

608
26:11.200 --> 26:12.400
Everything is normal.

609
26:12.400 --> 26:14.060
You can be rescheduled to fly.

610
26:18.400 --> 26:19.320
No need.

611
26:20.200 --> 26:21.530
I've decided to resign.

612
26:24.400 --> 26:27.330
I will try my best to find my dream-filled self again.

613
26:27.400 --> 26:29.280
I hope in the near future,

614
26:29.640 --> 26:31.500
I can return to the blue sky I love.

615
26:34.440 --> 26:35.900
You should keep it up, too.

616
26:36.920 --> 26:39.640
You are much braver than before.

617
26:49.080 --> 26:51.440
Mom, Dad.

618
26:54.360 --> 26:55.400
Growing up,

619
26:57.080 --> 26:58.480
I never had any ambitions

620
26:59.400 --> 27:00.640
or persistence.

621
27:01.400 --> 27:02.330
It's always been

622
27:02.880 --> 27:04.920
me doing whatever you told me to do.

623
27:06.920 --> 27:09.920
Including studying accounting and going to Honghu.

624
27:11.200 --> 27:14.600
I thought it would just go on like this.

625
27:15.360 --> 27:16.160
It was okay.

626
27:18.720 --> 27:20.680
But then I met Sister Long.

627
27:22.400 --> 27:24.530
For the first time, I made my own choice

628
27:25.160 --> 27:28.560
to leave Honghu and work with Sister Long.

629
27:29.880 --> 27:31.920
During the time I worked with her,

630
27:33.280 --> 27:34.440
I finally realized

631
27:35.240 --> 27:36.000
that

632
27:36.880 --> 27:38.600
a person can live a meaningful life.

633
27:38.600 --> 27:41.440
Xiao Longnv Law Firm is reopening.

634
27:41.440 --> 27:44.160
Congratulations on the opening.

635
27:44.160 --> 27:46.290
Life has something to look forward to.

636
27:49.560 --> 27:51.600
No matter how insignificant

637
27:52.000 --> 27:53.920
my efforts are,

638
27:55.560 --> 27:58.020
I can still gain my own sense of achievement.

639
27:59.400 --> 28:01.840
And I'm really lucky

640
28:02.040 --> 28:04.120
to have met such a group of partners.

641
28:07.440 --> 28:08.520
There aren't many of us,

642
28:08.520 --> 28:09.360
Cheers!

643
28:09.360 --> 28:11.200
but everyone is very important.

644
28:14.000 --> 28:15.460
That's also the reason why

645
28:18.160 --> 28:20.080
I must be by their side now.

646
28:26.320 --> 28:27.400
Just this once,

647
28:29.160 --> 28:30.000
okay?

648
28:31.240 --> 28:32.720
Why didn't you tell me this earlier?

649
28:32.720 --> 28:34.560
No, I didn't expect it to be this fast.

650
28:34.560 --> 28:36.360
Alright, stop talking. Go drive.

651
28:36.360 --> 28:37.600
Sister Long.

652
28:40.120 --> 28:41.400
Sister Long.

653
28:49.440 --> 28:50.320
Coming.

654
28:52.440 --> 28:54.440
You've got some nerve, little girl.

655
28:54.440 --> 28:56.240
You guys don't have to cover for me anymore.

656
28:56.240 --> 28:57.920
Sister Miaomiao, you're awesome.

657
28:57.920 --> 28:58.560
Of course.

658
29:00.360 --> 29:01.400
Thanks, Miao.

659
29:01.680 --> 29:02.600
For what, sister?

660
29:02.600 --> 29:03.600
I should be thanking you.

661
29:03.600 --> 29:06.160
I'm still waiting to be the administrative director.

662
29:06.160 --> 29:07.080
You want to be the director?

663
29:07.080 --> 29:08.600
Then I should be the president.

664
29:08.600 --> 29:10.440
Uncle, law firms don't have presidents.

665
29:10.440 --> 29:12.400
Why are you so obsessed with titles?

666
29:12.400 --> 29:13.640
You're talking too much.

667
29:13.640 --> 29:15.170
Alright, stop blabbering.

668
29:15.360 --> 29:16.600
Let's get to work, Director.

669
29:16.600 --> 29:17.160
Let's go.

670
29:17.480 --> 29:18.600
Let's go, President.

671
29:18.600 --> 29:19.960
Can't I lead you anymore?

672
29:19.960 --> 29:20.680
No, no.

673
29:20.960 --> 29:21.760
Whose man are you?

674
29:21.760 --> 29:22.640
I am my uncle's...

675
29:22.640 --> 29:23.440
I am Uncle Hu's man.

676
29:23.440 --> 29:25.170
You must tattoo it on your body.

677
29:25.400 --> 29:26.960
Uncle Hu's man.

678
29:32.800 --> 29:35.560
This is a 1.8-liter naturally aspirated engine

679
29:35.560 --> 29:36.000
with a CVT

680
29:36.000 --> 29:36.920
gearbox.

681
29:37.160 --> 29:39.600
It's super fuel-efficient to drive.

682
29:40.600 --> 29:40.880
This one.

683
29:40.880 --> 29:43.640
Look, this is a premium one-owner car.

684
29:43.720 --> 29:45.000
Look at all the glass,

685
29:45.000 --> 29:46.530
including the headlights.

686
29:46.640 --> 29:47.640
They are all original.

687
29:47.640 --> 29:48.920
They all come with inspection reports.

688
29:48.920 --> 29:49.600
Xiao Jun,

689
29:49.600 --> 29:51.080
all these vehicles of yours,

690
29:51.080 --> 29:52.960
every single one is from a legitimate source, right?

691
29:52.960 --> 29:55.200
No smuggled or stolen cars or anything?

692
29:55.200 --> 29:58.400
Why does your occupational disease keep acting up irregularly?

693
29:58.400 --> 30:00.920
Are you here to see me or to investigate a case?

694
30:00.920 --> 30:01.800
Stay vigilant.

695
30:01.800 --> 30:02.960
It's for your own good.

696
30:02.960 --> 30:04.560
If you happen to have a problematic car,

697
30:04.560 --> 30:06.360
you'll be implicated, you know?

698
30:06.560 --> 30:08.200
Just put your mind at ease

699
30:08.200 --> 30:09.480
and relax.

700
30:09.600 --> 30:11.480
All the cars in here

701
30:11.480 --> 30:13.920
are 100% absolutely from regular channels.

702
30:13.920 --> 30:14.920
My good intentions

703
30:14.920 --> 30:16.520
are treated like dirt by you.

704
30:18.440 --> 30:19.200
Alright, I'm off work.

705
30:19.200 --> 30:19.920
Come with me.

706
30:19.920 --> 30:20.800
Where to?

707
30:20.880 --> 30:22.120
Why ask so many questions?

708
30:22.120 --> 30:23.450
I can't sell you anyway.

709
30:23.480 --> 30:25.010
Even if I did, who would buy?

710
30:26.880 --> 30:28.440
What's wrong with an old man like me?

711
30:28.440 --> 30:30.000
I'm in high demand.

712
30:31.920 --> 30:33.560
Come on, come on.

713
30:33.800 --> 30:35.400
I'm here. Stand up.

714
30:36.800 --> 30:37.720
Welcome, Chief Li.

715
30:37.720 --> 30:38.560
Here, here, here.

716
30:38.560 --> 30:40.560
Welcome, a warm welcome.

717
30:40.880 --> 30:42.600
What Chief Li? I'm retired.

718
30:43.200 --> 30:44.640
Why so formal?

719
30:44.640 --> 30:45.120
What's this for?

720
30:45.120 --> 30:46.000
Today is the big day,

721
30:46.000 --> 30:48.400
the 30th anniversary of our Eight Great Guardians.

722
30:48.400 --> 30:49.400
We have to be formal.

723
30:49.400 --> 30:50.480
You guys are celebrating your anniversary.

724
30:50.480 --> 30:51.560
Why did you bring me here?

725
30:51.560 --> 30:52.200
Chief Li,

726
30:52.400 --> 30:54.640
you can't say 'anniversary' so lightly.

727
30:54.640 --> 30:55.920
It sounds like we old brothers

728
30:55.920 --> 30:57.920
were all wiped out 30 years ago.

729
30:58.360 --> 30:58.920
No, Ermao.

730
30:58.920 --> 31:00.560
If it weren't for Chief Li back then,

731
31:00.560 --> 31:01.920
we might have really been wiped out.

732
31:01.920 --> 31:03.000
Exactly. The time we almost got killed.

733
31:03.000 --> 31:04.120
So Chief Li is

734
31:04.120 --> 31:05.800
the most important person for our 30th anniversary.

735
31:05.800 --> 31:07.160
We have to invite him no matter what.

736
31:07.160 --> 31:07.680
Sit down. Come.

737
31:07.680 --> 31:09.200
Pour the wine. Pour the wine.

738
31:09.200 --> 31:10.400
Come, brother, let me pour it for you.

739
31:10.400 --> 31:11.000
Come, come, come.

740
31:11.000 --> 31:12.640
We're sticking to the old rules today.

741
31:12.640 --> 31:15.640
Whoever can walk a straight line after drinking pays the bill.

742
31:15.640 --> 31:16.400
Cut the crap.

743
31:16.400 --> 31:18.160
I'll treat. It's my treat today.

744
31:18.160 --> 31:19.120
Why do I say that?

745
31:19.120 --> 31:21.080
Because as the whole gang...

746
31:21.080 --> 31:22.240
Wait, what gang?

747
31:23.800 --> 31:24.360
Team.

748
31:24.360 --> 31:25.200
Right.

749
31:25.200 --> 31:26.400
As the team boss,

750
31:26.600 --> 31:28.800
I must treat you today.

751
31:28.800 --> 31:30.800
Brother, you're right about that,

752
31:30.800 --> 31:31.360
but

753
31:31.360 --> 31:33.000
can you still walk a straight line later?

754
31:33.000 --> 31:34.240
I can run. I run in a straight line.

755
31:34.240 --> 31:36.560
Whether it's a straight line or a curved line,

756
31:36.560 --> 31:38.000
who among you has ever paid the bill?

757
31:38.000 --> 31:40.730
Since you're the one who opened this restaurant.

758
31:41.480 --> 31:44.080
Thank you, Chief Li.

759
31:44.400 --> 31:49.240
A man is also a flower,

760
31:49.400 --> 31:52.600
also afraid of the wind and rain.

761
31:52.600 --> 31:58.400
Who can see the scars behind the strength?

762
31:58.680 --> 32:01.800
Men do shed tears,

763
32:01.960 --> 32:05.240
they just hide their broken hearts.

764
32:05.240 --> 32:07.640
I'd rather stand limping

765
32:07.680 --> 32:11.200
than kneel smiling.

766
32:11.800 --> 32:13.240
Come on, guys.

767
32:13.240 --> 32:14.000
Alright,

768
32:14.240 --> 32:14.960
stop singing a cappella.

769
32:14.960 --> 32:15.640
I'll take you guys later

770
32:15.640 --> 32:16.360
to a KTV.

771
32:16.600 --> 32:17.800
Thank you, thank you.

772
32:17.800 --> 32:19.460
Daqing is calling me. Daqing.

773
32:19.640 --> 32:20.840
Come over. Come over.

774
32:21.120 --> 32:22.720
I sent you that. Can you hear me?

775
32:22.720 --> 32:23.800
Come on.

776
32:23.800 --> 32:24.400
The few of us...

777
32:24.400 --> 32:25.480
The few of us are all here.

778
32:25.480 --> 32:26.960
Chief Li and everyone are here too.

779
32:26.960 --> 32:27.690
So come over.

780
32:27.800 --> 32:29.160
I'll send you the location later.

781
32:29.160 --> 32:29.640
Hello?

782
32:30.280 --> 32:30.800
Hello?

783
32:31.160 --> 32:32.890
Hello? Why aren't you talking?

784
32:33.400 --> 32:33.920
Hello?

785
32:35.680 --> 32:36.610
Someone's dead.

786
32:36.680 --> 32:38.480
Call the police quickly. So much blood.

787
32:38.480 --> 32:40.000
Who are you? Hello?

788
32:40.000 --> 32:41.440
Daqing, hello?

789
32:42.680 --> 32:43.400
Daqing.

790
32:46.720 --> 32:47.160
Wait,

791
32:47.400 --> 32:49.000
I think something happened.

792
32:58.240 --> 32:59.240
Get up, get up, get up.

793
32:59.240 --> 32:59.900
Don't push.

794
33:00.480 --> 33:01.720
My brother is the boss here.

795
33:01.720 --> 33:02.640
I came to take a look.

796
33:02.640 --> 33:03.480
Can I go in and take a look?

797
33:03.480 --> 33:05.140
Don't go in and ruin the scene.

798
33:05.720 --> 33:07.080
Daqing, don't ruin the scene.

799
33:07.080 --> 33:07.680
Daqing.

800
33:07.680 --> 33:08.400
Calm down.

801
33:08.480 --> 33:09.610
Step back, Xiao Jun.

802
33:09.720 --> 33:10.920
Xiao Jun, calm down. Daqing.

803
33:10.920 --> 33:12.640
Step back. Don't ruin the scene.

804
33:12.640 --> 33:14.900
Xiao Jun, do you want to get into trouble?

805
33:15.840 --> 33:16.600
Calm down.

806
33:17.320 --> 33:17.920
Calm down.

807
33:18.920 --> 33:19.760
Calm down.

808
33:33.080 --> 33:33.610
Brother.

809
33:34.240 --> 33:35.300
That watch of yours

810
33:35.640 --> 33:36.600
is really cool.

811
33:37.400 --> 33:38.160
Well,

812
33:38.400 --> 33:41.000
would you dare lend it to me for a couple of days?

813
33:42.080 --> 33:43.810
Pretend I didn't say anything.

814
33:44.400 --> 33:45.920
I'll tell you one more time.

815
33:45.920 --> 33:46.920
No fighting.

816
33:47.920 --> 33:49.320
If you don't listen to me,

817
33:49.480 --> 33:51.210
don't call me brother anymore.

818
33:51.440 --> 33:51.920
Don't worry.

819
33:51.920 --> 33:52.920
Don't worry.

820
33:59.400 --> 34:00.860
If you like it, it's yours.

821
34:01.000 --> 34:02.260
My brother is the best.

822
34:06.200 --> 34:07.240
Xiao Jun.

823
34:08.679 --> 34:11.210
These truck transportation routes in Leyang

824
34:11.880 --> 34:13.440
are almost all taken by you.

825
34:13.800 --> 34:14.639
What?

826
34:14.800 --> 34:16.400
Aren't you afraid of biting off more than you can chew?

827
34:16.400 --> 34:18.920
You are the big brother of empty truck freight.

828
34:18.920 --> 34:20.440
Leyang is only so big.

829
34:20.440 --> 34:21.699
If I have offended you,

830
34:21.920 --> 34:24.159
I, Xiao Jun, apologize to you, okay?

831
34:24.719 --> 34:26.050
Let me offer you a toast.

832
34:26.679 --> 34:27.159
Cheers.

833
34:27.440 --> 34:29.400
Cutting off someone's source of wealth

834
34:29.400 --> 34:30.679
is like killing their parents.

835
34:30.679 --> 34:32.920
Do you think you can leave today?

836
34:35.120 --> 34:36.159
Xiao Jun.

837
34:36.600 --> 34:38.360
Do you know what you are to me?

838
34:42.480 --> 34:43.940
You are nothing but a fart.

839
34:45.880 --> 34:47.120
How dare you insult my brother!

840
34:47.120 --> 34:47.800
Get him!

841
34:51.600 --> 34:52.800
Calm down, calm down.

842
34:52.960 --> 34:54.080
Xiao Jun, Daqing.

843
34:54.360 --> 34:55.000
Daqing.

844
34:57.160 --> 34:58.160
Step back, step back.

845
34:58.160 --> 34:59.600
Don't worry, don't worry.

846
34:59.600 --> 35:00.200
Step back.

847
35:01.640 --> 35:02.320
I don't want anything else.

848
35:02.320 --> 35:03.960
I just want to know how Zhao Deqing died.

849
35:03.960 --> 35:05.480
Haven't I already told you?

850
35:05.480 --> 35:07.000
The case is under investigation.

851
35:07.000 --> 35:08.160
We have no comment.

852
35:08.160 --> 35:09.240
What's the killer's name?

853
35:09.240 --> 35:09.840
Sir.

854
35:09.840 --> 35:11.680
Why don't you understand what I'm saying?

855
35:11.680 --> 35:12.480
About this,

856
35:12.640 --> 35:13.840
we can't disclose anything.

857
35:13.840 --> 35:15.240
We're not prying.

858
35:15.880 --> 35:17.200
I'm just inquiring.

859
35:18.160 --> 35:18.480
Sister.

860
35:18.480 --> 35:19.200
What is it?

861
35:19.720 --> 35:20.780
Who killed Daqing?

862
35:21.640 --> 35:23.080
How did Daqing die? What happened?

863
35:23.080 --> 35:24.540
Who exactly is the killer?

864
35:24.840 --> 35:26.900
I only know the killer is Fu Xiaochen.

865
35:27.000 --> 35:28.460
He's already been caught.

866
35:28.840 --> 35:30.440
Wait, is there anything else?

867
35:30.440 --> 35:32.400
No, that's all they told me.

868
35:32.480 --> 35:33.160
Listen, sister.

869
35:33.160 --> 35:33.840
You are Daqing's biological sister.

870
35:33.840 --> 35:34.720
And you are our sister too.

871
35:34.720 --> 35:35.680
Right. If you know anything,

872
35:35.680 --> 35:37.120
tell us quickly.

873
35:37.400 --> 35:38.460
Where does he live?

874
35:38.920 --> 35:40.960
Look, I haven't seen him for a long time either.

875
35:40.960 --> 35:42.480
What could I know?

876
35:43.800 --> 35:44.680
Hey, you...

877
35:44.680 --> 35:46.360
Hey, don't be afraid.

878
35:46.360 --> 35:46.960
Brother, you...

879
35:46.960 --> 35:47.690
Brother Jun.

880
35:48.040 --> 35:50.200
Don't we have someone in the police department?

881
35:50.200 --> 35:50.800
Right.

882
35:52.120 --> 35:54.040
How much do you know about my brother Daqing's case?

883
35:54.040 --> 35:54.960
Tell me now.

884
35:55.400 --> 35:56.200
Tell us.

885
35:58.000 --> 35:59.040
Tell you what?

886
35:59.720 --> 36:01.360
Are you interrogating me?

887
36:01.360 --> 36:02.400
Sorry, Chief Li.

888
36:02.920 --> 36:04.650
My brother used the wrong word.

889
36:04.760 --> 36:06.480
He meant to ask you to confess quickly.

890
36:06.480 --> 36:08.040
Used the wrong word?

891
36:08.120 --> 36:09.960
I think you're talking nonsense.

892
36:09.960 --> 36:11.360
Zhao Deqing was killed.

893
36:11.360 --> 36:13.360
Why are you guys getting involved?

894
36:13.360 --> 36:14.400
When the trial is over,

895
36:14.400 --> 36:15.720
everything will be clear, won't it?

896
36:15.720 --> 36:18.520
Yes, but don't you have an apprentice in the police department?

897
36:18.520 --> 36:19.720
Can you ask around for me?

898
36:19.720 --> 36:21.600
Do you own the police department?

899
36:21.800 --> 36:23.280
You think I can just ask around?

900
36:23.280 --> 36:25.520
During the investigation, anyone asking about the case

901
36:25.520 --> 36:26.480
is breaking the rules.

902
36:26.480 --> 36:27.960
Make an exception this time.

903
36:27.960 --> 36:28.840
I'm begging you.

904
36:28.840 --> 36:30.960
Look, in front of all my brothers,

905
36:30.960 --> 36:31.960
I'm officially begging you.

906
36:31.960 --> 36:32.640
Right.

907
36:33.280 --> 36:34.720
Stop with the nonsense.

908
36:35.040 --> 36:37.000
Even if you kneel down, it won't work.

909
36:37.000 --> 36:38.120
It's a matter of principle.

910
36:38.120 --> 36:39.520
You're still talking about principles?

911
36:39.520 --> 36:41.360
How many things have your bullshit principles ruined?

912
36:41.360 --> 36:43.080
Have you forgotten about Xiaoxin?

913
36:43.080 --> 36:44.680
Xiao Jun, what are you doing?

914
36:46.080 --> 36:46.920
Don't you know

915
36:46.920 --> 36:48.480
who you are?

916
36:48.880 --> 36:50.880
My brother is just anxious. He didn't mean it.

917
36:50.880 --> 36:51.810
Stay out of this.

918
36:52.600 --> 36:53.000
Take it easy.

919
36:53.000 --> 36:54.200
Why is Chief Li like this?

920
36:54.200 --> 36:56.400
He got mad when I said he has principles.

921
36:57.920 --> 36:59.200
He didn't use to have this temper.

922
36:59.200 --> 36:59.880
Brother.

923
37:01.000 --> 37:01.600
Brother Jun.

924
37:01.600 --> 37:03.360
My buddy sent a message.

925
37:03.360 --> 37:05.420
He said lawyers can review the files.

926
37:05.440 --> 37:07.240
Then we can figure it out, right?

927
37:07.400 --> 37:07.930
Let's go.

928
37:08.600 --> 37:09.440
Wait.

929
37:09.440 --> 37:10.360
Another message.

930
37:10.360 --> 37:12.480
We can't hire a lawyer.

931
37:12.480 --> 37:14.560
Only Daqing's relatives can hire a lawyer.

932
37:14.560 --> 37:15.920
Can you finish it in one breath?

933
37:15.920 --> 37:17.560
He sent it message by message.

934
37:17.560 --> 37:19.440
So I can only read it message by message.

935
37:19.440 --> 37:20.040
Let's go.

936
37:20.440 --> 37:21.800
Brother Xiao.

937
37:22.480 --> 37:24.600
We must find a lawyer for this.

938
37:24.600 --> 37:26.000
We have to find a lawyer.

939
37:26.040 --> 37:28.500
Only a lawyer can review the files, you know?

940
37:28.600 --> 37:30.400
That will cost a lot of money.

941
37:31.200 --> 37:32.800
Let's just forget it.

942
37:33.480 --> 37:36.540
My dad is still waiting for me at home to take care of him.

943
37:37.200 --> 37:38.200
My daughter runs the law firm.

944
37:38.200 --> 37:39.760
She won't charge you a penny.

945
37:39.760 --> 37:42.160
Your brother Daqing is like my own brother.

946
37:42.200 --> 37:43.600
You are like my own sister.

947
37:43.600 --> 37:44.600
About your brother's case.

948
37:44.600 --> 37:47.060
Don't worry. I promise I will see it through.

949
37:47.720 --> 37:48.680
I'll ask my daughter

950
37:48.680 --> 37:50.480
to review the files for us later.

951
37:50.480 --> 37:51.680
Review what files?

952
37:52.320 --> 37:53.760
It's in the investigation stage now.

953
37:53.760 --> 37:54.600
We can't review the files.

954
37:54.600 --> 37:56.800
We can only review the files during the review and prosecution stage.

955
37:56.800 --> 37:58.860
What nonsense are you talking about?

956
37:59.080 --> 38:00.360
This Ermao...

957
38:00.480 --> 38:02.360
He's too unreliable.

958
38:02.360 --> 38:03.200
He's...

959
38:03.680 --> 38:05.200
Daughter, can you look into it

960
38:05.200 --> 38:07.200
and arrange a death penalty for that guy?

961
38:07.200 --> 38:08.600
Dad, you think too highly of me.

962
38:08.600 --> 38:10.040
How can I arrange a death penalty?

963
38:10.040 --> 38:12.320
That's the job of the court and the procuratorate.

964
38:12.320 --> 38:13.250
Don't always...

965
38:14.000 --> 38:14.480
Then...

966
38:15.360 --> 38:17.080
Then what can you do?

967
38:17.080 --> 38:17.800
Then I...

968
38:22.360 --> 38:24.000
For cases like this,

969
38:24.080 --> 38:25.400
as a lawyer,

970
38:25.800 --> 38:29.200
I can file an incidental civil action

971
38:29.400 --> 38:31.860
and claim some compensation for the family.

972
38:32.200 --> 38:33.360
So you mean

973
38:33.920 --> 38:36.360
you can make the murderer's family pay some money?

974
38:36.360 --> 38:37.360
Yes, they have to pay.

975
38:37.360 --> 38:39.040
Just the death penalty would be letting him off too easy.

976
38:39.040 --> 38:41.320
Yes, that would be letting him off too easy.

977
38:41.320 --> 38:42.800
Is there any possibility

978
38:43.040 --> 38:45.000
to make them pay more?

979
38:45.000 --> 38:46.040
They definitely have to pay more.

980
38:46.040 --> 38:47.240
Come over here.

981
38:48.520 --> 38:51.200
Then you might have to issue a letter of forgiveness.

982
38:51.200 --> 38:52.360
With a letter of forgiveness,

983
38:52.360 --> 38:55.240
you can get extra compensation for mental distress.

984
38:55.240 --> 38:56.520
If the other party gets the letter of forgiveness,

985
38:56.520 --> 38:57.680
their sentence will be reduced.

986
38:57.680 --> 39:00.080
The compensation for mental distress can be relatively higher.

987
39:00.080 --> 39:01.240
Wait, what are you talking about?

988
39:01.240 --> 39:02.400
What forgiveness?

989
39:02.680 --> 39:04.320
Xiaolong, whose side are you on?

990
39:04.320 --> 39:06.480
Wait, how high is high?

991
39:06.480 --> 39:08.680
I mean, what's the maximum we can ask for?

992
39:08.680 --> 39:09.960
There is no legal limit.

993
39:09.960 --> 39:12.200
It could be hundreds of thousands or even millions.

994
39:12.200 --> 39:15.200
Anyway, we should ask for as much as possible.

995
39:15.200 --> 39:15.960
Well,

996
39:15.960 --> 39:18.320
it still depends on the other party's financial ability

997
39:18.320 --> 39:19.880
and their willingness to compensate.

998
39:19.880 --> 39:20.080
Wait.

999
39:20.080 --> 39:22.200
What the hell are you two talking about?

1000
39:22.200 --> 39:24.480
Someone died, and you two are doing business here?

1001
39:24.480 --> 39:25.080
No, Dad.

1002
39:25.080 --> 39:25.960
I'm working.

1003
39:25.960 --> 39:26.320
Why are you yelling?

1004
39:26.320 --> 39:27.200
What do you mean why am I yelling?

1005
39:27.200 --> 39:29.080
Is your job just about forgiveness?

1006
39:29.080 --> 39:31.320
Can murder be forgiven?

1007
39:31.320 --> 39:32.480
Zhao Deyan, let me tell you.

1008
39:32.480 --> 39:33.400
That's your own brother.

1009
39:33.400 --> 39:34.680
You can't let him down.

1010
39:34.760 --> 39:36.360
Xiao Jun, what are you doing?

1011
39:36.400 --> 39:37.520
Are you threatening her?

1012
39:37.520 --> 39:38.320
So what?

1013
39:38.320 --> 39:38.680
Brother Jun, let's...

1014
39:38.680 --> 39:39.760
Get out of the way. You stand there.

1015
39:39.760 --> 39:41.400
So what?

1016
39:44.680 --> 39:46.010
My dad is just like this.

1017
39:47.440 --> 39:48.560
Jun, calm down.

1018
39:48.560 --> 39:49.800
Why are you arguing with her?

1019
39:49.800 --> 39:51.480
She's just a kid, right?

1020
39:52.120 --> 39:52.680
Jun.

1021
39:52.680 --> 39:53.680
To be honest,

1022
39:54.120 --> 39:55.320
people as loyal as you

1023
39:55.320 --> 39:57.040
are really rare in today's society.

1024
39:57.040 --> 39:58.200
I really admire you.

1025
39:58.200 --> 39:59.800
Really, I totally understand how you feel.

1026
39:59.800 --> 40:01.320
I don't need your understanding right now,

1027
40:01.320 --> 40:02.080
you know?

1028
40:02.320 --> 40:03.680
If your brother was stabbed to death,

1029
40:03.680 --> 40:04.880
would you let the other party get a light sentence?

1030
40:04.880 --> 40:06.080
Of course not.

1031
40:06.200 --> 40:07.520
I'd cut him into a thousand pieces.

1032
40:07.520 --> 40:08.760
Even that wouldn't be enough.

1033
40:08.760 --> 40:09.320
See?

1034
40:09.480 --> 40:10.520
Anyone with a brain understands this.

1035
40:10.520 --> 40:12.320
Did you hear what she just said?

1036
40:12.320 --> 40:13.680
Yes, she was wrong.

1037
40:13.680 --> 40:15.080
She was biased.

1038
40:15.400 --> 40:17.320
But Jun, think about it from another angle.

1039
40:17.320 --> 40:18.520
You raised a good daughter.

1040
40:18.520 --> 40:19.520
As a lawyer,

1041
40:19.520 --> 40:20.600
she always stands

1042
40:20.600 --> 40:22.240
in her client's shoes.

1043
40:22.240 --> 40:24.840
How professional and what a good person she is.

1044
40:26.960 --> 40:27.760
Right?

1045
40:27.920 --> 40:28.850
What do you mean?

1046
40:29.760 --> 40:30.600
You two are in this together.

1047
40:30.600 --> 40:31.680
So you're helping her.

1048
40:31.680 --> 40:32.960
Look, you always misunderstand.

1049
40:32.960 --> 40:34.800
Why are you always so suspicious?

1050
40:34.800 --> 40:36.800
My stance is very neutral.

1051
40:36.800 --> 40:37.880
Neutral my ass.

1052
40:38.200 --> 40:39.760
You're just a fence-sitter.

1053
40:39.760 --> 40:40.240
Look, you always...

1054
40:40.240 --> 40:41.760
I don't have time to listen to your nonsense.

1055
40:41.760 --> 40:42.520
I'm not...

1056
40:42.520 --> 40:43.720
Look, get out of here.

1057
40:47.320 --> 40:48.680
Fine, I'll go. What are you yelling for?

1058
40:48.680 --> 40:50.480
Your whole family loves to yell.

1059
40:55.280 --> 40:56.520
Xin, did you understand?

1060
40:56.520 --> 40:57.800
That's the situation.

1061
40:57.800 --> 40:59.480
If you were the lawyer,

1062
40:59.480 --> 41:01.240
how would you fight this case?

1063
41:01.880 --> 41:03.540
From a lawyer's perspective,

1064
41:03.880 --> 41:06.240
I definitely have to respect the client's wishes.

1065
41:06.240 --> 41:07.960
My wish is that a life must be paid for with a life.

1066
41:07.960 --> 41:08.820
No, Godfather.

1067
41:08.880 --> 41:10.340
From a legal perspective,

1068
41:10.680 --> 41:12.760
there's no such thing as a life for a life.

1069
41:12.760 --> 41:14.320
No, the point is she keeps trying to

1070
41:14.320 --> 41:17.180
use a letter of forgiveness to reduce the sentence.

1071
41:17.240 --> 41:18.840
Then from this perspective,

1072
41:18.880 --> 41:20.520
the family can refuse to issue a letter of forgiveness.

1073
41:20.520 --> 41:21.080
In that case,

1074
41:21.080 --> 41:23.280
the suspect won't get a light sentence.

1075
41:23.760 --> 41:25.480
Xin, that's exactly what I was waiting to hear.

1076
41:25.480 --> 41:26.200
So,

1077
41:26.240 --> 41:28.400
I officially appoint you as my lawyer.

1078
41:29.360 --> 41:30.690
Who are you appointing?

1079
41:31.240 --> 41:32.000
You're not even a family member.

1080
41:32.000 --> 41:34.800
What right do you have to appoint anyone, Xiao Jun?

1081
41:35.400 --> 41:36.400
What are you doing?

1082
41:36.400 --> 41:37.520
Worshipping him?

1083
41:38.520 --> 41:39.760
So what if I am?

1084
41:39.760 --> 41:40.080
I'll get going.

1085
41:40.080 --> 41:41.520
I'm just... Wait a minute.

1086
41:41.520 --> 41:43.050
You'll be my legal advisor.

1087
41:43.320 --> 41:44.960
What do you mean he's your legal advisor?

1088
41:44.960 --> 41:46.200
Don't get involved in this.

1089
41:46.200 --> 41:47.680
Can you stop causing trouble?

1090
41:47.680 --> 41:49.080
How am I causing trouble?

1091
41:49.320 --> 41:50.080
Daqing is my brother.

1092
41:50.080 --> 41:51.200
I just want to know how he died.

1093
41:51.200 --> 41:52.320
Is there a problem with that?

1094
41:52.320 --> 41:53.480
His business is my business.

1095
41:53.480 --> 41:53.960
Let me tell you,

1096
41:53.960 --> 41:54.520
I won't forgive them.

1097
41:54.520 --> 41:55.400
Don't forgive them then.

1098
41:55.400 --> 41:56.880
Take a Green Dragon Crescent Blade and go kill them.

1099
41:56.880 --> 41:57.800
Blood for blood, right?

1100
41:57.800 --> 41:58.800
You think I don't want to?

1101
41:58.800 --> 42:00.200
What are you yelling for?

1102
42:13.480 --> 42:14.940
When you left their house,

1103
42:15.040 --> 42:16.440
were they still arguing?

1104
42:16.960 --> 42:17.960
They stopped arguing.

1105
42:17.960 --> 42:19.680
They each shut their doors

1106
42:19.680 --> 42:21.010
and ignored each other.

1107
42:21.080 --> 42:23.080
That living room is totally wasted.

1108
42:23.800 --> 42:26.400
With Zhao Deqing's matter between them,

1109
42:26.960 --> 42:29.420
it'd be weird if they didn't have conflicts.

1110
42:29.560 --> 42:32.320
Uncle Xiao went to prison twice because of Zhao Deqing.

1111
42:32.320 --> 42:34.400
How could Xiaolong not hold a grudge?

1112
42:34.400 --> 42:34.880
Yeah.

1113
42:34.880 --> 42:37.080
This time Uncle Xiao argued with Xiaolong over Zhao Deqing,

1114
42:37.080 --> 42:38.680
so she must be feeling upset.

1115
42:38.880 --> 42:40.480
Old Xiao has a thick skull.

1116
42:40.480 --> 42:42.410
He won't come around anytime soon.

1117
42:42.760 --> 42:45.200
He'll probably keep causing trouble.

1118
42:45.200 --> 42:46.680
Anyway, Dad, the way I see it,

1119
42:46.680 --> 42:49.040
you should keep a close eye on Uncle Xiao when you're free.

1120
42:49.040 --> 42:49.760
You're right.

1121
42:49.760 --> 42:51.840
We're actually on the same page this time.
